%% Activity diagram: a monitoring session (Mermaid flowchart used as UML activity diagram)
flowchart TD
    A([User taps Start monitoring]) --> B[Create session row<br/>load settings, reset alert policy]
    B --> C{App visible or<br/>background session?}
    C -- no --> P[Pause: record nothing] --> C
    C -- yes --> D[Read metrics]
    D --> E{Timestamp increasing<br/>and not duplicate?}
    E -- no --> W
    E -- yes --> F[Store sample]
    F --> G{Model loaded?}
    G -- yes --> H[Features -> Isolation Forest score]
    G -- no --> H2[Rule-based cold-start check]
    H --> I[Severity + explanation]
    H2 --> I
    I --> J{Category normal?}
    J -- yes --> W
    J -- no --> K[Store anomaly]
    K --> L{Alert policy:<br/>severity >= preference<br/>and not in cooldown?}
    L -- yes --> M[Store alert, notify if permitted]
    L -- no --> W
    M --> W[Wait interval<br/>doubled if battery <= 20%]
    W --> X{Stop requested?}
    X -- no --> C
    X -- yes --> Z([Close session])
